Error [jet.UnsafeCallOutsideUnsafe]: `add` is an `#Unsafe` function
  --> ffi_inline_cpp_call_needs_unsafe_region.jet:10:11
    |
 10 |     print(add(1, 2))
    |           ^^^
 Why: Its contract can't be checked by the compiler, so the caller must vouch for it
 Fix: Call it inside `#Unsafe("…") { … }`
